# SIX AI AGENTS THAT CAN DO THE WORK FOR YOU

### HOOK — 0–5 sec

Bharathi-ku work panna interest illa... aana avanoda pending work mala maadhiri irukku!

apo avan yosichan... "Enakku badhila work panna oru AI team irundha?"

### STORY START — 5–12 sec

Sunday night Bharathi nalla relax pannitu irundhaan.

Aana Monday-ku research, emails, marketing, coding, reports... list mudiyave illa!

Appo avan decide pannaan... "Indha velaiyellam naan yen pannanum? AI teammates irukkaangale!"

### FIRST THREE — 12–32 sec

**1. OpenAI Dots**

First, Bharathi hire pannadhu OpenAI Dots!

Idhu ChatGPT-kulla oru always-on worker maadhiri. Ongoing goal kuduthu, necessary apps connect pannittaa, background-la tasks continue panni progress report kondu varum.

Bharathi thoongumbodhu kooda avanoda work-ku attendance podra AI! 

**2. Meta Muse**

Next, Meta Muse!

Bharathi-ku travel booking, shopping, forms, reminders-nu ellathayum manage panna personal assistant venum.

Muse preferences remember panni everyday tasks handle panna help pannum. Important actions-ku approval-um kekkum.

Basically, Bharathi-oda personal assistant... aana avan vida organised-ah irukkum!

**3. Grok Bot**

Third, Grok Bot!

Bharathi-ku oru assistant mattum podhaadhu. Oru full team venum!

Research-ku oru bot, marketing-ku innoru bot, sales-ku vera bot.

Different bots work share pannitu collaborate pannalaam.

Bharathi-ku company start pannama company team ready!

### OPEN-SOURCE TEAM — 32–55 sec

Ippo Bharathi konjam technical-ah yosichaan...

"Indha agents-ah en control-la run panna mudiyuma?"

**4. OpenClaw**

First, OpenClaw!

Unga computer illa server-la run aagura gateway. WhatsApp, Telegram maadhiri chat apps connect panni AI assistant-kitta messages moolama tasks delegate pannalaam.

Bharathi-ku WhatsApp-la message panninaa podhum... computer-kitta poi ukkaara thevai illa!

**5. Hermes**

Next, Hermes!

Idhoda speciality enna theriyuma? It learns from experience!

Oru workflow kathukitta, adhai skill-ah save panni future-la reuse and improve panna mudiyum.

Bharathi-ku oru thadava solli kuduthaa, adutha thadava thirumba class edukka thevai illa!

**6. MausBot**

Last-ah, MausBot!

Different AI agent engines-ku separate bots create panni, ore workspace-la manage and coordinate panna help pannum.

Claude Code, Codex, Grok maadhiri agents-ah oru team-ah organise pannalaam.

Bharathi-oda AI Avengers team ready!

### RE-HOOK — 55–65 sec

Aana Bharathi oru important lesson kathukittaan!

Open-source-na ellame free-nu artham illa.

API costs, hosting, permissions, security... idhellam avan dhaan manage pannanum.

AI team hire pannadhu easy... HR work mattum innum Bharathi-kku dhaan!

### CLOSING — 65–72 sec

So, ongoing work-ku Dots, personal assistance-ku Muse, AI team-ku Grok Bot, self-hosting-ku OpenClaw, learning agent-ku Hermes, multi-agent workspace-ku MausBot!

Bharathi-oda team-la first yaar join aaganum?

Comment-la sollunga! Detailed comparison guide venumna **AGENTS** nu comment pannitu The Bot Academy follow pannunga!




# 9 MACHINE LEARNING TECHNIQUES IN REAL APPLICATIONS

### HOOK — 0–5 sec

Oru shopping app build panrom-nu imagine pannunga.

Customer-ku product recommend pannanum, delivery date predict pannanum, fraud detect pannanum...

Idhellam ore AI algorithm-kitta kudutha, adhuve confuse aayidum! 😂

### STORY — 5–12 sec

Actually, indha app-oda ovvoru feature-kum different Machine Learning technique use pannuvom.

Vaanga, indha app-kulla irukkura 9 ML techniques-ah paapom!

### THE FIRST FOUR — 12–32 sec

**1. Linear Regression**

Customer order place pannitaanga. "En package eppo varum?" nu 5 minutes-ku oru thadava track panraanga.

Previous delivery data analyse panni estimated delivery time predict pannradhu — **Linear Regression.**

**2. Logistic Regression**

Customer payment panraanga. Aana idhu genuine transaction-ah illa fraud-ah?

Probability calculate panni Yes or No decision edukkuradhu — **Logistic Regression.**

**3. Decision Tree**

Customer refund request podraanga.

Order value evlo? Return history irukka? Product condition enna?

Indha questions-ku answer base panni step-by-step decision edukkuradhu — **Decision Tree.**

**4. Random Forest**

Aana oru tree mattum decision edutha, thappa kooda pogalaam!

So, neraya decision trees-ah consult panni, majority vote edukkuradhu — **Random Forest.**

Basically, AI-oda Panchayat! 😂

### NEXT FOUR — 32–51 sec

**6. K-Nearest Neighbours**

Unga shopping taste-ku similar-ah irukkura customers-ah find pannum.

Avanga enna vaanginaangalo, adhe products ungalukkum suggest pannum.

Basically, unga shopping best friend! — **K-Nearest Neighbours.**

**7. K-Means Clustering**

Customers-ah analyse panni groups create pannum.

Budget shoppers, frequent buyers, premium customers-nu separate pannum.

Neenga endha gang-nu kandupidikkuradhu — **K-Means Clustering!**

**8. Neural Networks**

Product photo upload panreenga.

Adhu image-la irukkura patterns, shapes, features-ah analyse panni visually similar products-ah identify pannum.

Basically, AI-ku kannu kudukkuradhu! — **Neural Networks.**







# 9 MACHINE LEARNING TECHNIQUES IN REAL APPLICATIONS

### HOOK — 0–5 sec

Bharathi oru shopping app start pannitaan!

Aana customer-ku products recommend pannanum, delivery predict pannanum, fraud detect pannanum...

Paavam Bharathi! Idhellam ore algorithm-kitta kudutha, avanoda app vida algorithm dhaan crash aagidum!

### STORY — 5–12 sec

Appo Bharathi oru decision eduthaan.

"Indha app-la ovvoru problem-kum oru specialist AI venum!"

Vaanga, avanoda shopping app-kulla irukkura 9 Machine Learning techniques-ah paapom!

### THE FIRST FOUR — 12–32 sec

**1. Linear Regression**

First, Bharathi delivery team-kitta oru complaint!

"Customers ellarum package enga-nu daily 100 times kekkuraanga!"

Previous delivery data analyse panni, package eppo reach aagum-nu estimate pannradhu — **Linear Regression.**

Basically, Bharathi-oda delivery prediction department!

**2. Logistic Regression**

Next, oru customer payment panraanga.

Aana transaction genuine-ah illa fraud-ah?

Past transaction patterns base panni fraud probability calculate panni classification pannradhu — **Logistic Regression.**

Bharathi-oda app-ku ippo security guard-um vandhaachu!

**3. Decision Tree**

Ippo customer refund request podraanga.

Order value evlo? Return history irukka? Product damaged-ah?

Indha questions-ku answer base panni step-by-step decision edukkuradhu — **Decision Tree.**

Bharathi-ku refund approve panna kooda interview process vachittaanga!

**4. Random Forest**

Aana Bharathi-ku oru doubt!

"Oru tree mattum decision edutha, thappu aagiduchuna?"

So, pala decision trees-ah train panni, avanga predictions combine panni final decision edukkuradhu — **Random Forest.**

Basically, Bharathi-oda AI Panchayat! Oru per mattum illa, full committee decision!

### NEXT FOUR — 32–55 sec

**5. Gradient Boosting**

Ippo Bharathi product recommendations improve pannanum.

Previous customer behaviour base panni purchase probability predict panni, products-ah rank pannradhu — **Gradient Boosting.**

First attempt-la mistake irundhaalum, next models adhai correct panna learn pannum.

Bharathi-oda app-ku continuous improvement department!

**6. K-Nearest Neighbours**

Next, Bharathi notice pannaan...

Oru customer wireless headphones vaangirukkaaru. Avaroda taste-ku similar customers vera enna products vaanginaangalo, adhai recommend pannalaam!

Similar customers-ah find panni suggestions kudukkuradhu — **K-Nearest Neighbours.**

Basically, Bharathi-oda app-ku shopping best friend!

**7. K-Means Clustering**

Ippo Bharathi customers-ah observe panna start pannitaan.

Silar budget shoppers, silar frequent buyers, vera silar premium customers!

Buying behaviour base panni groups create pannradhu — **K-Means Clustering.**

Bharathi-ku customers-ah analyse panna analytics department ready!

**8. Neural Networks**

One customer product photo upload panraanga.

Bharathi-oda app image-la irukkura patterns, shapes, features analyse panni visually similar products identify pannudhu.

Idhu — **Neural Networks!**

Basically, Bharathi-oda app-ku kannu vandhaachu!

### FINAL REVEAL — 55–65 sec

**9. Large Language Models (LLMs)**

Last-ah, Bharathi app-la oru chatbot add pannaan.

Customer kekkuraanga...

"10,000 rupees-kulla oru nalla camera recommend pannunga!"

Question-ah understand panni, context-ku suitable-ah normal language-la answer kudukkuradhu — **LLM!**

Ippo Bharathi-oda app product sell pannradhu mattum illa... customers-kooda pesavum aarambichiduchu!

### CLOSING — 65–72 sec

So, Bharathi oru shopping app build pannaan... aana pinnadi work pannadhu 9 different ML techniques!

Neenga shopping panreengala... illa Bharathi unga shopping habits-ah study panraana?

Comment pannunga! More AI breakdowns-ku The Bot Academy follow pannunga!


So, next time shopping app open pannumbodhu, pinnadi evlo AI techniques work aagudhu-nu yosichu paarunga.

Neenga shopping panreengala... illa AI unga shopping habits-ah study pannudha-nu theriyadhu! 😂
